star, the imaginative writer, the dominant producer, the kind caterer, and more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive all that Hollywood dishes out and nab your very own leading lady?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will you choose\u2026?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/5b1259ff068191d43178ac6ff4aab0c9.avif?t=1764835559\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it the sexy, confident, celebrity bombshell?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/1a46ca376d91f47e5a9d82721179c34a.poster.avif?t=1764835559\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/1a46ca376d91f47e5a9d82721179c34a.webm?t=1764835559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/1a46ca376d91f47e5a9d82721179c34a.mp4?t=1764835559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it the bubbly and creative risk-taker with a beautiful smile?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/af9ebf7a408db4d9fad77c0aadb41a5f.poster.avif?t=1764835559\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/af9ebf7a408db4d9fad77c0aadb41a5f.webm?t=1764835559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it